# Claude Code — THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
# Local agent instructions and memory must never be committed here: they carry
# machine details, host addresses, absolute paths and credential locations.
# Project-scoped memory for this repo belongs in CLAUDE.local.md, which is
# ignored below and stays on the machine.
#
# Note: .claude/skills/yis/SKILL.md predates this rule and remains tracked --
# gitignore does not untrack existing files. It was audited 2026-08-17 and
# contains no machine details, addresses, paths or credentials. Leave it or
# remove it deliberately; do not add more.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/
